{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Palm Simulator 2 is a game in which you can become a palm tree. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers meditative gameplay. You can stand and contemplate the beauty of the beach around you, living your life as a palm tree. You can also perform the actions that palm trees usually do (mostly standing in the same place).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic change of day and night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New visual effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Canonical Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a palm tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're on the beach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are other palm trees around you </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And not only palm trees</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 game modes: arcade and realistic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887240?t=1773371412","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887240?t=1773371412","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887240/a8ab1f93eb0dba8644f5ba7390b8d1a8c1e9c09f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773371412","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887240/a8ab1f93eb0dba8644f5ba7390b8d1a8c1e9c09f/